/T (High Availability \(HA\): By actively distributing network resources and compute power across multiple distinct AWS Availability Zones \(AZs\) within the region, the architecture guarantees that regional data center anomalies will not disrupt application availability.)
/E (High Availability \(HA\): By actively distributing network resources and compute power across multiple distinct AWS Availability Zones \(AZs\) within the region, the architecture guarantees that regional data center anomalies will not disrupt application availability.)
