/P 58 0 R
/T (Internet access for private instances is strictly controlled through a NAT Gateway deployed in the public subnet. This allows backend servers to download critical security patches and software updates from the internet without exposing a public IP address that could be targeted by malicious actors. Internal DNS resolution is enabled for seamless hostname routing.)
/E (Internet access for private instances is strictly controlled through a NAT Gateway deployed in the public subnet. This allows backend servers to download critical security patches and software updates from the internet without exposing a public IP address that could be targeted by malicious actors. Internal DNS resolution is enabled for seamless hostname routing.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [3]
>>
