/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 58 0 R
/T (The foundation of this deployment is a custom Virtual Private Cloud \(VPC\) designed to provide strict logical isolation. We established a broad IPv4 CIDR block for the VPC to accommodate future expansion, which was then systematically subnetted to separate public-facing load balancers from private application and database servers. A strategic deployment across two Availability Zones ensures physical redundancy.)
/E (The foundation of this deployment is a custom Virtual Private Cloud \(VPC\) designed to provide strict logical isolation. We established a broad IPv4 CIDR block for the VPC to accommodate future expansion, which was then systematically subnetted to separate public-facing load balancers from private application and database servers. A strategic deployment across two Availability Zones ensures physical redundancy.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [4]
>>
