/T (Maintaining a highly available system requires comprehensive visibility into the health and performance of the infrastructure. Amazon CloudWatch is integrated deeply into all deployed resources. Custom CloudWatch Dashboards were created to aggregate metrics such as EC2 CPU Utilization, ALB Request Count, ALB HTTP 5xx Error Rates, and RDS Database Connections. This provides the engineering team with a single pane of glass to monitor real-time system health.)
/E (Maintaining a highly available system requires comprehensive visibility into the health and performance of the infrastructure. Amazon CloudWatch is integrated deeply into all deployed resources. Custom CloudWatch Dashboards were created to aggregate metrics such as EC2 CPU Utilization, ALB Request Count, ALB HTTP 5xx Error Rates, and RDS Database Connections. This provides the engineering team with a single pane of glass to monitor real-time system health.)
