/Title (Defense-in-Depth Security: The environment utilizes custom Virtual Private Clouds \(VPCs\), strict stateful Security Group boundaries, Network Access Control Lists \(NACLs\), and IAM roles to ensure that private backend resources remain completely invisible and isolated from the public internet.)
/Dest [10 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 184 0 R
