455 0 obj
<<
/Title (The foundation of this deployment is a custom Virtual Private Cloud \(VPC\) designed to provide strict logical isolation. We established a broad IPv4 CIDR block for the VPC to accommodate future expansion, which was then systematically subnetted to separate public-facing load balancers from private application and database servers. A strategic deployment across two Availability Zones ensures physical redundancy.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 309 0 R
/Next 512 0 R
>>
endobj
