/Title (Bootstrapping via User Data: Every instance is bootstrapped dynamically upon launch using a custom Bash script injected via EC2 User Data. This script updates the OS packages, installs the Nginx web server, downloads the latest application payload from an internal S3 bucket, and starts the necessary background services automatically.)
