/Title (Proving the integrity of the private network architecture is a crucial milestone. While the web servers are accessible via the load balancer, the backend database and internal processing nodes must remain completely isolated from public access, reachable only via internal VPC routing. To validate this, we executed internal connectivity tests from a compromised or authenticated session within the web tier.)
